                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "2026/02: we came back here for dinner and left the restaurant with full belly again 😋. Pastas were fresh and flavorful. The staff were very friendly and attentive. Another great experience at Radici/Elementi 🙌\n\n2025/11: We had an amazing experience for having lunch here. We can see our food made from scratch with fresh ingredients. Shrimp and clam spaghetti was so delicious that reminded us our trip to Positano and Tuscany. Grilled beef was tender and flavorful. Grilled king mushrooms with miso glaze is tasty. We will be back soon.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
